acceptance_criteria: "npx --yes @unbrained/pm-cli@<version> pm init succeeds in a clean workspace and so does the bunx equivalent; A leading positional equal to any declared bin name of this package is absorbed before subcommand resolution, so pm pm init behaves as pm init; The pm pseudo-command no longer appears in rendered root help, and no help surface invites a form the dispatcher refuses; verify-published-release.mjs gains required npx and bunx legs using the two-token short form, and a negative control proves the leg fails when dispatch is broken; No leg of the published-artifact verification asserts only on a flag that short-circuits before dispatch"
